On Wednesday, she wrote twice the number of articles she wrote on Tuesday, so she wrote $2 \times 7 = 14$ articles. So the time spent on Wednesday is $14 \times 4 = 56$ hours.
The total time is $20 + 28 + 56 = 104$ hours.

